<title>USA: TABLE - Morgan Stanley sells $350 mln debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Morgan Stanley sells $350 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co was priced Tuesday via lead manager Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter, according to a market source.</p>
<p>BORROWER MORGAN STANLEY, DEAN WITTER, DISCOVER &amp; CO</p>
<p>AMT $350 MLN	 COUPON 6.375 PCT  MATURITY 8/1/02</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.535  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 6.485 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD +42 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662))</p>
</text>
